              "instruction": "mẽ ṭikiṭ līdhī",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *mẽ ṭikiṭ līdhī*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "spoken": true,
              "id": "GU-C148-lidhun-r1",
              "prompt": "Say that you ate rice and took the medicine.",
              "assesses": [
                "GU-GRAMMAR-C148-DHUN-01",
                "GU-GRAMMAR-C148-OBJECT-AGREE-01"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 20,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "mẽ bhāt khādho ane davā līdhī",
                "મેં ભાત ખાધો અને દવા લીધી.",
                "mẽ bhāt khādho, ane davā līdhī"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "bhāt is masculine and davā feminine: khādho, līdhī.",
                "incorrect": "Let each object choose: bhāt khādho, davā līdhī."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which three verbs take -ધું? (લેવું, ખાવું, પીવું.) Why ખાધો with ભાત? (ભાત is masculine.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
